    "residualRisks": [
      "Importing modernc.org/sqlite/vec in the future would add sqlite-vec code and require its upstream license text, a new artifact review, and regenerated evidence before release.",
      "Version 1.55.0 began interpreting mattn/go-sqlite3-compatible DSN aliases that 1.50.0 ignored. This project generates only the pre-existing _pragma form, whose accepted semantics are unchanged, and the complete test suite passed; any future externally supplied DSN using those aliases requires compatibility review.",
      "Passing the checked tests and vulnerability scan reduces but does not eliminate regression risk in the upgraded database engine."
